WEBVTT

01:49.150 --> 01:50.777
Come on! The goal is right here!

01:51.277 --> 01:52.112
Keep it up!

01:52.737 --> 01:53.863
Nine hours and twelve minutes.

01:54.489 --> 01:57.283
Not a bad time, considering the weather.

01:59.035 --> 02:00.829
I thought we were going to die out there.

02:01.663 --> 02:04.415
No one has ever said
winter training would be this tough.

02:05.416 --> 02:07.585
Damn it, I can't feel my legs.

02:07.919 --> 02:10.338
I wish they had let us inside already.

02:10.713 --> 02:13.967
I bet they're busy putting together
a huge feast for us! Yum...

02:14.592 --> 02:15.426
Hey!

02:16.761 --> 02:17.595
Christa is missing.

02:18.096 --> 02:18.930
What?

02:19.139 --> 02:22.725
She was sticking with Daz
since he wasn't doing so well.

02:23.268 --> 02:24.811
Daz isn't here either.

02:25.436 --> 02:26.855
Ymir as well.

02:27.147 --> 02:29.107
Maybe they're with the last squad?

02:29.566 --> 02:30.525
Can't be.

02:30.733 --> 02:32.861
The last squad, led by Thomas,
just arrived.

02:33.153 --> 02:34.654
They never saw those three.

02:35.029 --> 02:35.864
-What?
-What?

02:39.492 --> 02:42.954
-You don't think they got lost?
-Hey...

02:43.454 --> 02:45.999
they don't stand a chance
if they're stuck in this blizzard.

02:46.332 --> 02:47.167
Shit!

02:48.585 --> 02:49.502
Eren!

02:49.878 --> 02:53.006
-I'm going back out to find them!
-Me too.

02:53.548 --> 02:55.049
Everyone, get in the cabin.

02:55.633 --> 02:57.135
-But Christa and--
-Yes.

02:57.802 --> 02:59.804
We'll send a rescue team
first thing in the morning.

03:00.221 --> 03:01.681
It will be too late by then!

03:02.140 --> 03:03.349
We can't have more victims!

03:12.984 --> 03:14.152
Shit.

03:28.708 --> 03:29.626
Christa.

03:31.753 --> 03:33.796
Christa, give it up.

03:36.216 --> 03:38.176
-Listen to me.
-Never.

03:40.929 --> 03:42.889
Daz already has one foot in the grave.

03:43.890 --> 03:46.351
It's his own fault for doing this training
to boost his grade

03:46.643 --> 03:49.979
without knowing
how much his body can take.

03:50.939 --> 03:53.608
He's just not cut out to be a soldier.

03:54.943 --> 03:58.071
If you keep crawling
to the foot of the mountain at this rate,

03:58.613 --> 04:02.617
you'll probably be a goner by then,
and we would be lucky not to be.

04:03.243 --> 04:05.286
Which means there are only two choices.

04:06.329 --> 04:11.084
Leave Daz here and save ourselves,
or all three of us die.

04:11.960 --> 04:13.127
What will it be?

04:15.046 --> 04:16.172
You forgot one.

04:17.006 --> 04:19.133
That your prediction is entirely wrong.

04:19.509 --> 04:23.721
I'll be able to reach our base
at the foot of the mountain with Daz.

04:24.347 --> 04:26.849
You can go ahead and get back safely.

04:27.809 --> 04:28.851
How about that?

04:29.769 --> 04:31.562
There's no trouble in it for you.

04:32.146 --> 04:34.148
We'll make it back for sure.

04:34.774 --> 04:35.733
Go ahead of us.

04:52.458 --> 04:53.293
Hey.

04:53.584 --> 04:56.337
Why haven't you asked me to help at all?

04:58.464 --> 04:59.465
I think...

05:00.008 --> 05:02.218
you have no intention of saving Daz.

05:16.149 --> 05:20.111
You've resigned yourself to death already.

05:22.864 --> 05:25.950
You're hoping to die here, aren't you?

05:26.993 --> 05:29.746
How could you?
I thought you were a good girl.

05:30.663 --> 05:34.584
You have to at least make it look like
you're trying to save his life.

05:35.168 --> 05:39.255
If you want people to remember you
as a hero who died trying to save someone,

05:39.547 --> 05:41.549
don't drag him down with you.

05:42.133 --> 05:43.968
That's what a bad girl would do.

05:44.719 --> 05:45.553
You're wrong!

05:47.305 --> 05:48.139
I didn't...

05:48.973 --> 05:49.974
That's not...

05:55.188 --> 05:56.064
I...

05:59.400 --> 06:00.401
It's you, right?

06:00.818 --> 06:03.321
The mistress' daughter
who had people after your life.

06:04.781 --> 06:06.240
How do you know?

06:07.575 --> 06:08.534
I see...

06:09.118 --> 06:10.870
So it was you after all.

06:12.413 --> 06:14.207
It's something I happened to overhear.

06:16.667 --> 06:18.586
At a church in the interior,

06:19.087 --> 06:22.256
back when I snuck around
borrowing things to stay alive.

06:25.009 --> 06:26.427
What a sob story it was.

06:27.303 --> 06:29.972
An illegitimate child can't succeed
a powerful noble.

06:30.973 --> 06:35.645
So they just wanted to kill her,
to end all the fuss once and for all.

06:36.312 --> 06:38.523
But they would look the other way
if she changed her name

06:38.606 --> 06:40.942
and lived a humble life.

06:42.151 --> 06:46.197
In the end, I heard the girl was forced
to join the Cadet Corps.

06:48.658 --> 06:49.659
Don't you worry.

06:50.451 --> 06:54.205
I haven't told anyone.
I don't plan to either.

06:55.123 --> 06:55.998
Then...

06:56.916 --> 06:59.710
did you enter the Cadet Corps
just to find me?

07:00.461 --> 07:01.671
If that's the case...

07:02.255 --> 07:03.172
why?

07:05.925 --> 07:06.759
Who knows.

07:07.135 --> 07:09.554
-Maybe it's because we're similar.
-What?

07:10.763 --> 07:14.100
You and I have similar backgrounds?

07:15.268 --> 07:17.228
Well, more or less.

07:18.729 --> 07:20.731
That's the reason you became a soldier?

07:21.482 --> 07:23.818
Could be. I don't really know.

07:24.569 --> 07:26.028
No, it's not.

07:28.030 --> 07:29.073
You wanted...

07:29.866 --> 07:31.200
to become friends with me?

07:32.410 --> 07:34.954
What? You've got to be kidding me.

07:38.374 --> 07:40.501
You and I can't even be compared.

07:41.252 --> 07:43.463
We both got a second chance at life.

07:44.213 --> 07:46.340
But I'm not the one
who took on a fake name.

07:47.133 --> 07:50.178
If I abandon my name
and reject who I am, they win.

07:50.887 --> 07:54.849
I'm going to keep the name I have
and make the best out of my life.

07:55.266 --> 07:58.436
That's the one and only way
I can get my revenge.

07:59.270 --> 08:01.272
So how do you explain yourself?

08:01.981 --> 08:03.107
Are you going to commit suicide

08:03.524 --> 08:05.943
and make everyone
who ruined your life happy?

08:06.819 --> 08:08.946
Why is your desire to kill
aimed at yourself?

08:09.280 --> 08:13.326
If you're so eager,
use that passion to change your own fate!

08:14.410 --> 08:17.788
I can't. Even now.

08:20.374 --> 08:23.544
There's no way the three of us
can make it out of here alive.

08:25.463 --> 08:26.714
-There is.
-What?

08:36.057 --> 08:38.226
I can see the base straight down
from here.

08:41.896 --> 08:44.607
-We drop Daz off this cliff.
-What?

08:45.233 --> 08:49.278
Hopefully, he survives the fall,
and someone down there finds him.

08:50.029 --> 08:52.657
Sure, it might be a long shot, but...

08:54.242 --> 08:56.244
that's his only real chance now.

08:56.744 --> 09:01.249
Unless a miracle happens, he'll be
an icicle long before you drag him down.

09:01.582 --> 09:02.416
But...

09:02.917 --> 09:04.794
But he'll die for sure if he falls!

09:06.087 --> 09:06.921
Shut up!

09:07.380 --> 09:08.923
What? Quit it!

09:09.674 --> 09:10.508
Ymir!

09:10.925 --> 09:13.094
I'll do it myself, so get moving already!

09:35.992 --> 09:37.118
It can't be...

09:38.411 --> 09:39.412
Wait!

09:40.871 --> 09:41.956
Ymir, wait!

09:48.004 --> 09:49.005
They're both...

09:52.258 --> 09:53.092
gone.

09:56.345 --> 09:58.472
It's better if you guys don't come along.

09:59.348 --> 10:03.394
Like our instructor said,
you'll only end up becoming victims.

10:03.894 --> 10:05.855
I'm going so that doesn't happen.

10:06.522 --> 10:08.190
I'm not leaving Christa and the others.

10:09.692 --> 10:12.194
Hey. What do you think you're doing?

10:12.903 --> 10:14.030
Don't try to stop--

10:14.113 --> 10:16.240
You're going to need
a lot more gear than that.

10:18.075 --> 10:21.954
If you go by yourself,
you'll be in the same pickle as Christa.

10:22.288 --> 10:24.624
In a search, the more eyes, the better.

10:25.374 --> 10:26.417
You guys...

10:27.668 --> 10:28.586
Thanks.

10:29.003 --> 10:31.213
-To be honest, we could use you.
-Hey.

10:32.173 --> 10:33.382
We're coming too.

10:34.091 --> 10:36.052
The weather's steadily improving.

10:36.719 --> 10:39.430
-I think we'll be fine.
-I brought extra rations!

10:39.889 --> 10:40.848
You guys...

10:47.104 --> 10:48.898
What was that sound just now?

10:58.240 --> 10:59.200
Somebody's coming!

11:16.008 --> 11:16.967
Ymir...

11:18.803 --> 11:21.722
Took you long enough.
I got here before you.

11:22.723 --> 11:26.727
I told Reiner and the others I had to wait
since you would come along eventually.

11:28.562 --> 11:30.856
What a stupid thing I've done...

11:31.690 --> 11:32.566
Where's Daz?

11:45.996 --> 11:47.289
That was the cliff?

11:49.458 --> 11:51.210
But you didn't have any rope.

11:52.002 --> 11:53.754
Even if you did, it's too high.

11:54.713 --> 11:56.757
How did you get Daz down from there?

12:02.054 --> 12:02.930
Why not?

12:03.681 --> 12:05.641
I think I can trust you.

12:06.725 --> 12:07.560
However...

12:08.644 --> 12:09.562
promise me.

12:10.646 --> 12:14.316
When I reveal my secret to everyone,
promise me.

12:15.985 --> 12:18.112
Take back your old name and live.

12:33.419 --> 12:34.503
Ymir!

12:36.881 --> 12:38.716
I felt the same, Christa.

12:39.550 --> 12:42.720
That it would have been better
if I was never born at all.

12:43.721 --> 12:46.682
I was hated by the world
just for existing.

12:47.558 --> 12:48.392
I...

12:48.934 --> 12:52.563
To give countless people joy,
I gave up my life.

12:53.814 --> 12:57.401
But from that time,
there was a wish I held in my heart.

12:58.486 --> 13:01.363
If, someday,
I was given a second chance at life...

13:01.864 --> 13:02.740
this time...

13:03.741 --> 13:05.534
I would live for no one but myself!

13:21.008 --> 13:22.009
Is this true?

13:23.135 --> 13:25.095
Ymir is a Titan, too?

13:25.846 --> 13:26.722
Ymir...

13:28.140 --> 13:30.809
That Titan is...

13:37.691 --> 13:39.193
From that day...

13:54.959 --> 13:57.086
Thanks, Reiner.

13:58.128 --> 14:00.506
Oh, it hurts! Reiner, my leg!

14:00.923 --> 14:02.925
Reiner! That's enough!

14:03.300 --> 14:05.177
Let her leg go! Her leg!

14:05.761 --> 14:06.637
Hey!

14:09.306 --> 14:11.892
-Sorry.
-No, you saved me.

14:12.518 --> 14:15.104
Did you know, Christa?

14:16.647 --> 14:19.316
That Ymir is a Titan?

14:21.652 --> 14:22.945
I had no idea.

14:24.196 --> 14:25.906
I was always so close to her, too.

14:26.532 --> 14:28.951
How? How could this be?

14:31.912 --> 14:33.956
That Titan is Ymir?

14:37.001 --> 14:41.255
In other words,
she knew some of the secrets of our world.

14:41.839 --> 14:43.799
I never suspected a thing.

14:45.926 --> 14:48.679
Hey, do you think she's known about it?

14:49.805 --> 14:54.101
Eren's a Titan too,
but he didn't know until it happened.

14:54.602 --> 14:55.853
But Ymir is like...

14:56.270 --> 14:58.564
She was aware of being a Titan all along.

15:00.107 --> 15:02.943
Are you saying
she might be an enemy of humanity?

15:03.152 --> 15:05.905
I'm saying
that's one hell of a power to hide.

15:06.822 --> 15:09.283
Who knows what she might
have been thinking?

15:10.326 --> 15:13.162
What could be Ymir's goal?

15:23.088 --> 15:24.173
Ymir!

15:49.615 --> 15:50.616
She's...

15:54.078 --> 15:55.162
What was that?

15:55.579 --> 15:58.457
Is she worried about the tower falling?

15:59.041 --> 16:00.084
She has to be.

16:00.709 --> 16:02.086
If she wanted to,

16:02.419 --> 16:05.589
Ymir could use her power
to escape on her own.

16:06.340 --> 16:08.509
And yet, she's not doing that.

16:10.719 --> 16:11.804
It's us...

16:12.471 --> 16:14.598
She's risking her life to protect us.

16:18.852 --> 16:19.937
Why?

16:22.815 --> 16:23.941
Why?

16:24.483 --> 16:25.359
Ymir!

16:28.737 --> 16:30.322
Don't you die, Ymir!

16:30.489 --> 16:32.992
-Not in a place like this!
-Hey!

16:33.242 --> 16:35.494
Don't pretend like you're good, you idiot!

16:37.538 --> 16:41.250
Do you want to go out in a blaze of glory?
Are you stupid?

16:41.583 --> 16:44.169
It's too late for you
to try and get into heaven!

16:44.503 --> 16:46.422
Live for yourself, goddamn it!

16:47.548 --> 16:49.800
If you're going to die protecting
this tower,

16:50.009 --> 16:51.260
forget about it!

16:51.427 --> 16:53.429
-Tear it down!
-Hey!

17:07.359 --> 17:10.195
Hey! She's really tearing it down!

17:10.279 --> 17:11.905
Keep it up, Ymir!

17:16.118 --> 17:19.079
Do you want to live? Grab onto me!

17:56.366 --> 17:57.451
Titans again?

17:57.534 --> 18:00.120
Hey, ugly! Go and finish the job!

18:07.377 --> 18:08.462
Ymir!

18:16.220 --> 18:17.429
This looks bad.

18:32.361 --> 18:33.737
Ymir is...

18:35.989 --> 18:37.199
This can't...

18:38.283 --> 18:39.493
This can't...

18:41.703 --> 18:42.538
Christa!

18:43.622 --> 18:44.540
This can't...

18:44.957 --> 18:46.083
Ymir, wait!

18:48.085 --> 18:49.044
I still...

18:49.503 --> 18:51.296
want to talk to you!

18:52.256 --> 18:53.090
I still...

18:53.757 --> 18:55.592
I still haven't told you...

18:56.426 --> 18:58.053
my real name!

19:11.150 --> 19:12.276
Wait...

19:13.652 --> 19:14.611
I still...

19:25.581 --> 19:28.000
Christa. Everyone, get back.

19:29.042 --> 19:32.462
Leave the rest to us.

19:32.838 --> 19:33.714
Mikasa!

19:42.055 --> 19:44.141
Disperse and cover the area!

19:44.391 --> 19:47.686
The rest of us will attack
where the Titans are gathering!

19:47.769 --> 19:48.645
Got it!

19:49.313 --> 19:50.147
Hey!

19:50.272 --> 19:52.357
We don't need you
to be a part of the attack!

19:54.943 --> 19:55.861
Die!

19:57.863 --> 19:59.990
I did it! My first kill!

20:05.162 --> 20:07.998
You moron! I told you to stay back, Eren!

20:08.332 --> 20:09.708
Right! I'm sorry!

20:10.375 --> 20:12.669
-Ouch!
-Hey!

20:13.587 --> 20:14.671
Eren!

20:15.380 --> 20:16.632
You guys!

21:06.306 --> 21:07.307
It can't be...

21:08.183 --> 21:09.518
Ymir is...

21:15.399 --> 21:16.316
Ymir...

21:31.039 --> 21:32.291
My real name is...

21:34.042 --> 21:35.961
Historia.

23:32.536 --> 23:35.831
There was no damage seen along Wall Rose.

23:36.706 --> 23:40.836
So how is it that Titans appeared
on the inside of the wall?

23:42.045 --> 23:43.338
Thrown into confusion,

23:43.630 --> 23:45.048
the Scouts decide to return to Trost

23:45.590 --> 23:48.176
with doubts weighing heavily
on their minds.

23:49.219 --> 23:50.637
However...

23:51.138 --> 23:55.559
Eren learns a shocking secret,
one that changes everything.

23:56.935 --> 24:00.188
Next episode, "Warrior."
